WEBVTT

00:00:00.088 --> 00:00:04.562
Guided updates require the restricted Linux host update service and

00:00:04.562 --> 00:00:06.112
matching application mounts.

00:00:06.512 --> 00:00:10.588
Install the checksummed host kit once during an idle maintenance window,

00:00:11.088 --> 00:00:13.712
then activate the matching application image.

00:00:14.100 --> 00:00:17.538
An enabled and active host service alone does not prove that the

00:00:17.538 --> 00:00:18.750
container has been updated.

00:00:19.175 --> 00:00:23.600
Windows Docker Desktop retains its reviewed manual update procedure.

00:00:24.012 --> 00:00:26.988
The web application does not need the Docker socket.

00:00:28.142 --> 00:00:32.429
Open Appliance Operations, Updates, and Review Storage Before Upload.

00:00:32.829 --> 00:00:36.892
Check the capacity allowance and review eligible cleanup candidates.

00:00:37.292 --> 00:00:40.979
Remove only specifically reviewed obsolete artifacts.

00:00:41.379 --> 00:00:45.404
Keep the selected package, retained rollback material and protected

00:00:45.404 --> 00:00:46.067
backups.

00:00:46.467 --> 00:00:48.192
Nothing is automatically pruned.

00:00:48.592 --> 00:00:52.079
Storage review cannot approve an installation, and a fixed amount

00:00:52.079 --> 00:00:55.979
of free space is not a guarantee that backup and image expansion

00:00:55.979 --> 00:00:56.504
will fit.

00:00:57.671 --> 00:01:02.871
Obtain the complete trusted offline ZIP and verify its independently

00:01:02.883 --> 00:01:03.708
published checksum.

00:01:04.083 --> 00:01:08.596
Upload and verify the ZIP, then select its imported package and check

00:01:08.596 --> 00:01:09.196
readiness.

00:01:09.596 --> 00:01:13.496
The service checks image identity, protocol, Compose and database

00:01:13.508 --> 00:01:15.946
access, storage and active work.

00:01:16.346 --> 00:01:20.171
Resolve every blocker and obtain a fresh readiness plan.

00:01:20.571 --> 00:01:24.858
Importing a package does not run its host installer or replace the

00:01:24.871 --> 00:01:25.796
running application.

00:01:26.962 --> 00:01:31.075
Review the version and interruption notice, then type the exact I

00:01:31.175 --> 00:01:34.362
N S T A L L phrase shown.

00:01:34.775 --> 00:01:38.788
The plan expires after fifteen minutes and is bound to that operation.

00:01:39.200 --> 00:01:41.150
Select Back Up and Install once.

00:01:41.550 --> 00:01:45.825
The guided service stops the application, verifies the backup pair

00:01:46.138 --> 00:01:49.938
and recreates the application while PostgreSQL remains running.

00:01:50.312 --> 00:01:54.625
Reconnect after interruption and inspect the retained operation rather

00:01:54.625 --> 00:01:55.550
than submitting again.

00:01:56.700 --> 00:02:00.812
Review the completed operation report and verify the exact running

00:02:00.812 --> 00:02:04.950
image, source commit, application health and database readiness.

00:02:05.362 --> 00:02:09.538
The general release label may still say version one point eight point

00:02:09.550 --> 00:02:11.000
five release candidate one;

00:02:11.525 --> 00:02:14.100
the build identity distinguishes patches.

00:02:14.512 --> 00:02:19.000
Check saved configurations, credentials, pipelines, schedules and

00:02:19.000 --> 00:02:21.775
recovery profiles before resuming automation.

00:02:22.175 --> 00:02:26.112
Keep the receipts and download the sanitized operation report.

00:02:27.308 --> 00:02:31.808
If the console is reachable, the previous-image recovery control requires

00:02:31.821 --> 00:02:35.971
independent database compatibility confirmation and its exact rollback

00:02:35.971 --> 00:02:36.596
phrase.

00:02:37.008 --> 00:02:41.083
It restores the retained application image, not the database, data,

00:02:41.521 --> 00:02:44.396
host settings or changes made to Nutanix targets.

00:02:44.796 --> 00:02:48.983
Use authorized host recovery when the console is unavailable.

00:02:49.396 --> 00:02:54.583
Connected discovery is metadata-only: unattended downloads and automatic

00:02:54.583 --> 00:02:56.221
installation are not enabled.
